Show the subscription usage windows next to the composer's context ring.

Reads rate_limits from session.usage events and the omnigent.rate_limits
session label, and renders "5h 23% · 7d 41%" in the composer workspace bar
with a tap-to-open popover for reset times (the desktop and mobile apps load
this same web UI). Base: omnigent v0.15.0 (c8b9b85f822f).

